🚽 Test case: takes_cstring() declares a STDROT_CSTRING parameter, which
🚽 stdrot_type_to_vartype() maps to VAR_STRING for static checking. A
🚽 char-array argument (`yap path[256]`) is source-level VAR_CHAR (the
🚽 element type), but the runtime bridge already accepts it for a
