🚽 branch produces STDROT_STRING, and coerce_arg_to_param() already
🚽 converts STDROT_STRING -> STDROT_CSTRING) -- rejecting the call on the
🚽 strength of the array's plain element type would be a false negative
🚽 against a call the ABI can actually service.
skibidi main {
    yap path[256];
